          : "The problem. Around it: the dimensions the agent named, their values, the design points it evaluated and the requirements.")
      + sec("At a glance", list([exploredDims.size + " of " + Object.keys(data.dimensions).length + " dimensions settled by some design point",
          pointValues.size + " values taken by some design point", steps.length + " design points evaluated"
          + (data.budget && data.budget.max_points ? " (budget " + data.budget.max_points + ")" : ""),
